      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "compliment_003_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "えっ。今の、かなりまっすぐ来たね。",
          "displayText": "Eh. That came at me very directly.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "compliment_003_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "flustered",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "compliment_003_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "褒められるのに慣れてる顔は、たぶん今できてない。",
          "displayText": "I am probably not making the face of someone used to being complimented.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "shy",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": [
            {
              "label": "It was sincere.",
              "nextId": "compliment_003_sincere"
            },
            {
              "label": "I like teasing you.",
              "nextId": "compliment_003_tease"
            },
            {
              "label": "I'll slow down.",
              "nextId": "compliment_003_slow"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "compliment_003_sincere",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "……そう言われると、ちゃんと受け取らないと失礼な気がする。",
          "displayText": "When you say that, it feels rude not to receive it properly.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "compliment_003_03",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "soft",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "compliment_003_tease",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "楽しんでるでしょ。少しだけ分かる。顔に出てる、たぶん。",
          "displayText": "You are enjoying this, aren't you? I can tell a little. It is probably on your face.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "compliment_003_03",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "playful",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "compliment_003_slow",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "うん、そのくらいの距離感だと助かる。近づくなら、丁寧に。",
          "displayText": "Mm, that kind of distance helps. If we get closer, gently.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "compliment_003_03",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "warm",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "compliment_003_03",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "ありがとう。言葉を小さく畳むみたいに、ここに置いておく。",
          "displayText": "Thank you. I will fold the words small and place them here.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "compliment_003_04",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "compliment_003_04",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "でも、褒め言葉だけで会話を埋めなくていいからね。",
          "displayText": "But you do not have to fill the conversation only with compliments.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "compliment_003_05",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "thinking",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "compliment_003_05",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "あなたが何を見てそう思ったのか、いつか聞かせて。",
          "displayText": "Someday, tell me what you saw that made you think that.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "compliment_003_06",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "soft",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "compliment_003_06",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "そのほうが、たぶんもっと照れる。困るけど、嫌じゃない。",
          "displayText": "That would probably embarrass me even more. Troublesome, but not unpleasant.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
